	ABORTED
	ORTHOGRAPHIC_VARIANT
	SUPERFLUOUS
	NUDUM
	NULL_NAME
	SUPPRESSED
	REJECTED_OUTRIGHT
	REJECTED
	ILLEGITIMATE
	INVALID
	DENIED
}

"""
Where a name usage in a GBIF checklist comes from: SOURCE when the checklist lists it, or a value that says GBIF
